g geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Stephen stops on the boulder-strewn pier during his walk by the sea.","it":"Stephen si ferma sul molo cosparso di massi durante la passeggiata in riva al mare.","fr":"Stephen s’arrête sur la jetée couverte de blocs pendant sa promenade au bord de la mer.","es":"Stephen se detiene en el espigón cubierto de rocas durante su paseo junto al mar."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"burke","collection":"core","name":"Burke’s pub","noteHash":"b0ad0d5421b6a52ebe6f73e120906a04","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"782f6c08f3234a3999a38ffb98ca5f021e7ec32726da5eabdf5e363e81785434","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"After leaving the maternity hospital, the group heads towards Burke’s pub near Fenian Street.","it":"Dopo aver lasciato l’ospedale di maternità, il gruppo si dirige verso il pub di Burke presso Fenian Street.","fr":"Après avoir quitté la maternité, le groupe se dirige vers le pub de Burke près de Fenian Street.","es":"Tras salir de la maternidad, el grupo se dirige al pub de Burke, cerca de Fenian Street."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"canaldock","collection":"core","name":"Grand Canal Docks","noteHash":"c749408131d89d5c369fd43906f574b8","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"dd9a27ba587c6961e96b64652da13ac9a28fa1251833a7cba17a890e86c87203","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The procession pauses by the bridge over Grand Canal Docks, a basin once accessible to boats.","it":"Il corteo si ferma presso il ponte sui Grand Canal Docks, un bacino un tempo accessibile alle barche.","fr":"Le cortège s’arrête près du pont sur les Grand Canal Docks, bassin autrefois accessible aux bateaux.","es":"El cortejo se detiene junto al puente sobre los Grand Canal Docks, dársena antaño accesible a embarcaciones."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"castle","collection":"core","name":"Castle Courtyard","noteHash":"8da9ded649cbb20f141cc0aae4afdb8e","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"9a071e86995e4761515b10529d40a8c1c3184c476b405769087018396b76a09f","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The courtyard of Dublin Castle is one of the settings of the viceregal procession episode.","it":"Il cortile del castello di Dublino è una delle ambientazioni dell’episodio del corteo vicereale.","fr":"La cour du château de Dublin est l’un des décors de l’épisode du cortège vice-royal.","es":"El patio del castillo de Dublín es uno de los escenarios del episodio del cortejo virreinal."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"cemetery","collection":"core","name":"Glasnevin entrance","noteHash":"bf87b4de1c4410466c168f4caeca1a57","positionSource":"117c6ea9dc66e7b6e78a6f3752b90e56927bd25f260d3c90b4fbe119fe6c6456","narrativeSource":"73e01a57233a7f0cd7693bc725cc3329f6ee269c44bb2bc2f550f303a6aebaf5","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The entrance to Glasnevin Cemetery leads to the grounds where Dignam’s funeral takes place.","it":"L’ingresso del cimitero di Glasnevin conduce al luogo in cui si svolge il funerale di Dignam.","fr":"L’entrée du cimetière de Glasnevin mène au lieu des obsèques de Dignam.","es":"La entrada del cementerio de Glasnevin conduce al lugar donde se celebra el funeral de Dignam."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"chapel","collection":"core","name":"Mortuary chapel","noteHash":"e8c33ac5bb0e4b11780700a793f0bb24","positionSource":"72913abbd08000db90b73e8a528df32fa3ce