 prima di raggiungere Prospect Avenue.","fr":"Le cortège funèbre traverse un canal à Cross Guns Bridge avant d’atteindre Prospect Avenue.","es":"El cortejo fúnebre cruza un canal por Cross Guns Bridge antes de llegar a Prospect Avenue."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"dlugacz","collection":"core","name":"Dlugacz’s butcher’s shop","noteHash":"5d844001966976ec53f940c9d0f5d20c","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"1c37c18296b58d8899350c1aa87381d1a63002ac1a6d112d5a4fae95b2db06b7","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Dlugacz’s fictional butcher’s shop is where Bloom buys a kidney for breakfast.","it":"Nella macelleria immaginaria di Dlugacz, Bloom compra un rognone per colazione.","fr":"Dans la boucherie fictive de Dlugacz, Bloom achète un rognon pour son petit déjeuner.","es":"En la carnicería ficticia de Dlugacz, Bloom compra un riñón para desayunar."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"dunne","collection":"core","name":"Miss Dunne’s office","noteHash":"437c1fcf57f37fb68e82e7169f8e0984","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"a0a863a362ed8b437d5ca9012a5a1e975e3b0d3366c8e712c5fb92d89415fb97","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Miss Dunne works at an office whose identification with a real advertising company remains a hypothesis.","it":"Miss Dunne lavora in un ufficio la cui identificazione con un’agenzia pubblicitaria reale resta un’ipotesi.","fr":"Miss Dunne travaille dans un bureau dont l’identification à une agence de publicité réelle reste hypothétique.","es":"Miss Dunne trabaja en una oficina cuya identificación con una agencia publicitaria real sigue siendo una hipótesis."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"green","collection":"core","name":"Green Street Courthouse","noteHash":"d72e284d82e115f1379508a3e531ca2b","positionSource":"ac966300240c92f0cdd80e77fadf301c04ce38486d4eb98718876ad9632938e5","narrativeSource":"db6c0c2e8aad17cc005526d02c8046f2b14f0dc12e611a6e7c85931500eb3921","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The Green Street Courthouse is associated with discussion of a trial and the search for Bloom nearby.","it":"Il tribunale di Green Street è legato alla discussione di un processo e alla ricerca di Bloom nelle vicinanze.","fr":"Le tribunal de Green Street est lié à la discussion d’un procès et à la recherche de Bloom dans le quartier.","es":"El tribunal de Green Street se relaciona con la discusión de un juicio y con la búsqueda de Bloom en sus cercanías."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"howth","collection":"core","name":"Howth Road junction","noteHash":"5b5548c99882296af5fe5a4655b2890e","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"4b21d6beb743f1cd91fc18ccb38135012f4b35dd9fcf703dd46b9c08a5caf48c","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"At the Howth Road junction, Conmee’s journey continues towards Malahide Road and Artane.","it":"All’incrocio di Howth Road il viaggio di Conmee prosegue verso Malahide Road e Artane.","fr":"Au carrefour de Howth Road, le trajet de Conmee continue vers Malahide Road et Artane.","es":"En el cruce de Howth Road, el viaje de Conmee continúa hacia Malahide Road y Artane."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"irishtown","collection":"core","name":"Irishtown Road","noteHash":"a897a34433ad0c6f2bb25e361a195319","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"aeb90dd1a0df6c7b46fc36819ea4f3098278488db844257bdebec6245b5227bc","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Bloom sees Stephen in Irishtown, near the former Watery Lane.","it":"Bloom vede Stephen a Irishtown, vicino all’antica Watery Lane.","fr":"Bloom aperçoit Stephen à Irishtown, près de l’ancienne Watery Lane.","es":"Bloom ve a Stephen en Irishtown, cerca de la antigua Watery Lane."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"kelleher","collection":"core","name":"H. J. O’Neill’s undertaking business","noteHash":"6e96194765f85efd535d9d48661317a5","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"29873f4e6ee728f77e4dfdcd682a583f2f11c55b781ddb3a4630760e5268d3dc","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Corny Kelleher works at H. J. O’Neill’s undertaking business.","it":"Corny Kelleher lavora nell’impresa di pompe funebri di H. J. O’Neill.","fr":"Corny Kelleher travaille dans l’entreprise de pompes funèbres de H. J. O’Neill.","es":"Corny Kelleher trabaja en la funeraria de H. J. O’Neill."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"kernan","collection":"core","name":"Crimmins’s","noteHash":"42013bbaf05223a2eae9cc93724a1fb1","positionSource":"005155eb46a86861c841dc79d9eb6f583c3cce7e367e4aba6f207ac7a5be7170","narrativeSource":"68e0013065364a2e5819dc3568514ed539d94c08bd8aee38fbb5ade91642a21c","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Kernan leaves Crimmins’s merchant premises and heads towards Watling Street.","it":"Kernan lascia il negozio del commerciante Crimmins e si dirige verso Watling Street.","fr":"Kernan quitte le commerce de Crimmins et se dirige vers Watling Street.","es":"Kernan sale del comercio de Crimmins y se dirige hacia Watling Street."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"leahy","collection":"core","name":"Leahy’s Terrace steps","noteHash":"7da4064faeee1d6950d46970ee1a804b","positionSource":"725a97f6f2f76aa41a194da9567ac553f892c8f40114a5ba03b310b3ed11967c","narrativeSource":"5c3d81bb2062a60c48c21f8b0251c45b3fd4fab3da260d35d34009495fb4eee8","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The steps at Leahy’s Terrace gave access to the shore before land reclamation changed the coast.","it":"I gradini di Leahy’s Terrace davano accesso alla riva prima che le bonifiche modificassero la costa.","fr":"Les marches de Leahy’s Terrace donnaient accès au rivage avant que les remblais ne modifient la côte.","es":"Los escalones de Leahy’s Terrace daban acceso a la orilla antes de que los rellenos modificaran la costa."}}}]'::jsonb; expected integer := 23;
begin
 if (select count(*) from public.place_descriptions d join jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,"noteHash" text,"positionSource" text,"narrativeSource" text,description jsonb) on d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection where md5(coalesce(d.note,''))=x."noteHash" and d.position_source_id::text=x."positionSource" and d.narrative_source_id::text is not distinct from x."narrativeSource" and (not (coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb) ? 'positionDescription') or d.metadata->'positionDescription'=x.description)) <> expected then raise exception 'A source or summary changed; no updates applied'; end if;
 update public.place_descriptions d set metadata=jsonb_set(coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb),'{positionDescription}',x.description,true) from jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,description jsonb) where d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection;
end $revision$;
commit;
